---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { ppfOptions } from '../data/catalog';
const officialFilms = ppfOptions.filter((film) => film.officialProduct);
---
<SiteLayout title="Rodim PPF Information & Consultation" description="Compare current Rodim PPF options with Crest Automotive Care in DLF Gurugram. Explore official Rodim product details, then plan a vehicle-specific estimate with Crest." currentPath="/rodim" pageNumber="03" pageLabel="Rodim PPF">
  <div class="rodim-page">
    <video class="rodim-pinned-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto" aria-hidden="true"><source src="/rodim-assets/rodimppf.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video>
    <section class="rodim-hero"><div class="rodim-hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Crest Automotive Care · Rodim PPF</span><h1>Protection with a<br /><em>point of view.</em></h1><p>Compare Rodim paint protection films by finish, road use and protection intent. Crest can assess your paint condition and intended coverage before preparing a local estimate.</p><div class="rodim-actions"><a class="button button-gold" href="/estimate">Build a Crest estimate <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-action" href="https://rodim.in/about-us/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View official Rodim details <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><small class="external-note">Rodim product pages and warranty terms are hosted and maintained by Rodim.</small></div><div class="rodim-hero-panel"><span>RODIM PPF / CREST CONSULTATION</span><strong>Choose the film<br />for the way you drive.</strong><small>Paint assessment · coverage planning · estimate</small></div></section>
    <section class="rodim-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">How to choose</span><h2>Start with the<br /><em>finish you want.</em></h2></div><p>PPF is a considered layer, not a promise against every form of damage. The right recommendation depends on the vehicle, paint condition, driving environment and the coverage you want to protect.</p></section>
    <section class="choice-grid" aria-label="Rodim PPF film intents"><article><span>01 / DAILY</span><h3>Clarity and gloss</h3><p><strong>Rodim R1</strong> is positioned by Rodim for daily-driven vehicles with high optical clarity, self-healing and UV blocking.</p></article><article><span>02 / ROAD USE</span><h3>More structural strength</h3><p><strong>Rodim R2</strong> is suited to owners seeking increased thickness, impact and scratch protection for demanding roads.</p></article><article><span>03 / PERFORMANCE</span><h3>Severe-exposure protection</h3><p><strong>Rodim R3 Pro</strong> uses an ultra-thick TPU construction for extreme impact, chemical and corrosion exposure.</p></article><article><span>04 / FINISH</span><h3>Stealth or gloss transformation</h3><p><strong>Rodim R2 Matt Finish</strong> brings a satin surface for owners who prefer a more understated finish.</p></article></section>
    <section class="film-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">The current range</span><h2>Compare the<br /><em>Rodim films.</em></h2></div><p>Explore verified product pages on Rodim.in, then keep the vehicle-specific planning and estimate with Crest.</p></div><div class="film-list">{officialFilms.map((film, index) => <article class="film-card"><div class="film-index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</div><div><h3>{film.name}</h3><p>{film.positioning}</p><span class="film-coverage">{film.coverage}</span>{film.warranty && <small class="film-warranty">{film.warranty}</small>}</div><div class="film-links"><a href={film.officialUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View {film.name} on Rodim.in <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/estimate">Build a Crest estimate <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article>)}</div></section>
    <section class="warranty-section"><div><span class="eyebrow">Warranty & care</span><h2>Read the terms<br /><em>before you book.</em></h2></div><div><p>Rodim’s official warranty description addresses eligible defects such as large-area cracking, blistering and adhesive residue in the Rodim TPU PPF itself, subject to its conditions and exclusions. Coverage is not unconditional: improper use, maintenance and cleaning, accidents, natural disasters, normal wear and unrelated causes are among the exclusions described by Rodim. Repainted panels may also be excluded in specified circumstances.</p><p class="warranty-disclosure">Product warranty terms, coverage, eligibility and exclusions are governed by Rodim’s official terms and installation-specific documentation. Crest does not administer or replace Rodim’s product warranty.</p><a class="text-action" href="https://rodim.in/product-warranty-service-description/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View warranty terms on Rodim.in <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
    <section class="rodim-cta"><div><span class="eyebrow">Your Crest next step</span><h2>Assess the car.<br /><em>Then choose well.</em></h2></div><div><p>Tell Crest your model, paint condition and intended coverage. We will help you compare the range and confirm the appropriate estimate before booking.</p><a class="button button-gold" href="/contact">Talk to Crest <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
.rodim-page{background:#f8f8f4;color:#17324d}.rodim-page section{padding:140px max(24px,calc((100% - 1240px)/2))}.rodim-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:70px;align-items:end;min-height:640px;background:#123d66;color:#fff}.rodim-hero-copy{max-width:700px}.rodim-hero h1{margin:22px 0;font-size:clamp(52px,7vw,96px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.07em}.rodim-hero h1 em,.rodim-intro h2 em,.film-section h2 em,.warranty-section h2 em,.rodim-cta h2 em{color:#e49b57;font-style:normal}.rodim-hero p{max-width:620px;color:#d8e5ee;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7}.rodim-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;align-items:center;margin-top:34px}.rodim-hero .text-action{color:#fff}.external-note{display:block;margin-top:25px;color:#b6cbd9;font-size:11px}.rodim-hero-panel{min-height:450px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:end;padding:30px;background:rgba(7,12,18,.16);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25)}.rodim-hero-panel span,.rodim-hero-panel small{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em}.rodim-hero-panel strong{margin:24px 0 8px;font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,44px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.05em}.rodim-hero-panel small{color:#c9d8e2}.rodim-intro,.section-heading,.warranty-section,.rodim-cta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:70px;align-items:end}.rodim-intro h2,.section-heading h2,.warranty-section h2,.rodim-cta h2{margin:18px 0 0;font-size:clamp(44px,5vw,72px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.065em}.rodim-intro>p,.section-heading>p,.warranty-section>div:last-child,.rodim-cta>div:last-child{max-width:500px;color:#5d7183;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75}.choice-grid{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;padding-top:0!important}.choice-grid article{min-height:260px;padding:24px;border-top:2px solid #e49b57;background:#eff3f1}.choice-grid span,.film-index{color:#8b542e;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em}.choice-grid h3{margin:56px 0 12px;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.04em}.choice-grid p,.film-card p,.warranty-section p,.rodim-cta p{color:#5d7183;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.film-section{background:#eef3f8}.film-list{margin-top:50px;border-top:1px solid #cbdcd6}.film-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:55px 1fr 290px;gap:22px;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbdcd6;align-items:start}.film-card h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:27px;letter-spacing:-.04em}.film-card p{max-width:620px;margin:0 0 14px}.film-coverage,.film-warranty{display:block;color:#385b78;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}.film-warranty{margin-top:8px;color:#8b542e}.film-links{display:grid;gap:14px}.film-links a,.rodim-page .text-action{color:#385b78;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase}.film-links a:last-child{color:#8b542e}.warranty-section{background:#fff5e9;align-items:start}.warranty-section h2{font-size:clamp(38px,4vw,60px)}.warranty-section>div:last-child{max-width:650px}.warranty-disclosure{padding:18px 20px;border-left:2px solid #e49b57;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);color:#385b78!important}.rodim-cta{background:#0c2d4a;color:#fff}.rodim-cta>div:last-child{color:#d8e5ee}.rodim-cta p{color:#d8e5ee}.rodim-cta .eyebrow{color:#e49b57}.rodim-cta h2{font-size:clamp(44px,5vw,72px)}@media(max-width:900px){.rodim-hero,.rodim-intro,.section-heading,.warranty-section,.rodim-cta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:35px}.choice-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)!important}.film-card{grid-template-columns:45px 1fr}.film-links{grid-column:2;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap}}@media(max-width:620px){.rodim-page section{padding:80px 20px}.rodim-hero{padding-top:110px}.rodim-hero-panel{min-height:330px}.rodim-hero h1{font-size:clamp(46px,13vw,64px)}.rodim-hero p{font-size:16px}.choice-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}.choice-grid article{min-height:0}.choice-grid h3{margin-top:32px}.film-card h3{font-size:22px}.film-links{display:grid}.rodim-intro h2,.section-heading h2,.warranty-section h2,.rodim-cta h2{font-size:44px}}
</style>
<style is:global>
  /* Rodim blue panels need an ink reversal: never allow the light-site overrides to create blue-on-blue text. */
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta { color: #fff !important; }
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero h1,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero h1 em,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero p,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero .eyebrow,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero .external-note,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta h2,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta h2 em,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta p,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta .eyebrow { color: #fff !important; }
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero h1 em,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta h2 em,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero .eyebrow,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta .eyebrow { color: #f0b275 !important; }
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero .text-action,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero .text-action:hover,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta .text-action,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta .text-action:hover { color: #fff !important; }
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero-panel,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero-panel strong,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero-panel span,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero-panel small { color: #fff !important; }
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero-panel span { color: #f0b275 !important; }
</style>

<style is:global>
  /* Rodim PPF page only: the uploaded muted video is the sole visual background. */
  body:has(.rodim-page),
  body:has(.rodim-page) main,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .rodim-page { background: transparent !important; }
  body:has(.rodim-page) .site-header,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .site-header.is-scrolled { background: rgba(255,255,255,.76) !important; color: #0c2d4a !important; border-bottom-color: rgba(255,255,255,.72) !important; backdrop-filter: blur(22px) saturate(145%) !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(22px) saturate(145%) !important; }
  body:has(.rodim-page) .site-footer { background: #0c2d4a !important; color: #fff !important; opacity: 1 !important; backdrop-filter: none !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important; }
  .rodim-page { position: relative; isolation: isolate; min-height: 100vh; overflow: clip; color: #fff !important; }
  .rodim-pinned-video { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: -2; width: 100vw; height: 100svh; object-fit: cover; pointer-events: none; background: #05080c; }
  .rodim-page::after { content: ''; position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: -1; pointer-events: none; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(2,5,9,.34), rgba(2,5,9,.14) 42%, rgba(2,5,9,.5)); }
  .rodim-page section { position: relative; z-index: 1; background: transparent !important; color: #fff !important; }
  .rodim-hero { min-height: 100svh !important; padding-top: clamp(130px, 16vh, 190px) !important; padding-bottom: 100px !important; align-items: center !important; }
  .rodim-hero-copy, .rodim-hero-panel, .rodim-intro > div, .rodim-intro > p, .choice-grid article, .section-heading > div, .section-heading > p, .film-card, .warranty-section > div, .rodim-cta > div {
    background: rgba(7,12,18,.16) !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.27) !important;
    border-radius: 24px !important;
    box-shadow: inset 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,.17), inset -1px -1px rgba(255,255,255,.035), 0 22px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.22) !important;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px) saturate(110%) !important;
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px) saturate(110%) !important;
    color: #fff !important;
  }
  .rodim-hero-copy { padding: clamp(26px, 4vw, 48px) !important; }
  .rodim-hero-panel { min-height: 330px !important; padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px) !important; background: rgba(7,12,18,.16) !important; }
  .rodim-hero-panel::before, .rodim-hero-panel::after { display: none !important; }
  .rodim-intro, .section-heading, .warranty-section, .rodim-cta { align-items: stretch !important; }
  .rodim-intro > div, .section-heading > div, .warranty-section > div, .rodim-cta > div { padding: clamp(22px, 3vw, 34px) !important; }
  .rodim-intro > p, .section-heading > p, .warranty-section > div:last-child, .rodim-cta > div:last-child { padding: clamp(22px, 3vw, 34px) !important; margin: 0 !important; }
  .choice-grid { padding-top: 0 !important; }
  .choice-grid article { padding: clamp(22px, 3vw, 32px) !important; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.27) !important; }
  .film-section, .warranty-section, .rodim-cta { background: transparent !important; }
  .film-list { margin-top: 50px; border-top: 0 !important; display: grid; gap: 16px; }
  .film-card { padding: clamp(22px, 3vw, 32px) !important; align-items: start; }
  .film-card + .film-card { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.27) !important; }
  .warranty-disclosure { background: rgba(255,255,255,.08) !important; border-left-color: rgba(255,255,255,.65) !important; }
  .rodim-page h1, .rodim-page h2, .rodim-page h3, .rodim-page p, .rodim-page span, .rodim-page small, .rodim-page strong, .rodim-page a { color: #fff !important; }
  .rodim-page h1 em, .rodim-page h2 em, .rodim-page .eyebrow, .rodim-page .film-index, .rodim-page .film-warranty { color: #f0b275 !important; }
  .rodim-page p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.88) !important; }
  .rodim-page .button-gold { color: #081018 !important; background: rgba(255,255,255,.9) !important; }
  .rodim-page .text-action, .rodim-page .film-links a { color: #fff !important; text-decoration-color: rgba(255,255,255,.55); }
  .rodim-page .external-note { color: rgba(255,255,255,.7) !important; }
  .rodim-float-in { opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0, 42px, 0) scale(.985); transition: opacity .8s ease, transform .9s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1); }
  .rodim-float-in.is-visible { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .rodim-hero, .rodim-intro, .section-heading, .warranty-section, .rodim-cta { gap: 22px !important; }
    .rodim-hero-panel { min-height: 260px !important; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .rodim-page section { padding: 82px 16px !important; }
    .rodim-hero { padding-top: 110px !important; min-height: 100svh !important; }
    .rodim-hero-copy, .rodim-hero-panel, .rodim-intro > div, .rodim-intro > p, .choice-grid article, .section-heading > div, .section-heading > p, .film-card, .warranty-section > div, .rodim-cta > div { border-radius: 20px !important; }
    .rodim-hero-copy { padding: 22px 18px !important; }
    .rodim-hero-panel { min-height: 230px !important; padding: 20px !important; }
    .rodim-intro > div, .section-heading > div, .warranty-section > div, .rodim-cta > div, .rodim-intro > p, .section-heading > p, .warranty-section > div:last-child, .rodim-cta > div:last-child { padding: 20px !important; }
    .choice-grid article, .film-card { padding: 19px !important; }
    .rodim-float-in { transform: translate3d(0, 28px, 0) scale(.99); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .rodim-float-in { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; } }
</style>
<script>
  const lockRodimMute = () => {
    const rodimVideo = document.querySelector('.rodim-pinned-video');
    if (!(rodimVideo instanceof HTMLVideoElement)) return;
    rodimVideo.muted = true;
    rodimVideo.defaultMuted = true;
    rodimVideo.volume = 0;
    rodimVideo.setAttribute('muted', 'muted');
    rodimVideo.removeAttribute('controls');
  };
  lockRodimMute();
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', lockRodimMute);
  const rodimVideo = document.querySelector('.rodim-pinned-video');
  if (rodimVideo instanceof HTMLVideoElement) {
    ['play', 'playing', 'loadedmetadata', 'canplay', 'volumechange', 'durationchange'].forEach((eventName) => rodimVideo.addEventListener(eventName, lockRodimMute));
  }
  const rodimCards = document.querySelectorAll('.rodim-page .rodim-hero-copy, .rodim-page .rodim-hero-panel, .rodim-page .rodim-intro > *, .rodim-page .choice-grid article, .rodim-page .section-heading > *, .rodim-page .film-card, .rodim-page .warranty-section > *, .rodim-page .rodim-cta > *');
  rodimCards.forEach((card) => card.classList.add('rodim-float-in'));
  const rodimObserver = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => entries.forEach((entry) => entry.target.classList.toggle('is-visible', entry.isIntersecting)), { rootMargin: '0px 0px -12% 0px', threshold: .08 });
  rodimCards.forEach((card) => rodimObserver.observe(card));
</script>

<style is:global>
  body:has(.rodim-page) .site-header,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .site-header.is-scrolled { background: rgba(255,255,255,.76) !important; color: #0c2d4a !important; border-bottom-color: rgba(255,255,255,.72) !important; backdrop-filter: blur(22px) saturate(145%) !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(22px) saturate(145%) !important; }
  body:has(.rodim-page) .site-footer { background: #0c2d4a !important; color: #fff !important; opacity: 1 !important; backdrop-filter: none !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important; }
  body:has(.rodim-page) .rodim-page::after { display: none !important; }
</style>

<style is:global>
  body:has(.rodim-page) .rodim-hero-copy:hover,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .rodim-hero-panel:hover,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .rodim-intro > *:hover,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .choice-grid article:hover,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .section-heading > *:hover,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .film-card:hover,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .warranty-section > *:hover,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .rodim-cta > *:hover {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.94) !important;
    border-color: #fff !important;
    color: #123d66 !important;
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }
  body:has(.rodim-page) .rodim-hero-copy:hover *,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .rodim-hero-panel:hover *,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .rodim-intro > *:hover *,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .choice-grid article:hover *,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .section-heading > *:hover *,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .film-card:hover *,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .warranty-section > *:hover *,
  body:has(.rodim-page) .rodim-cta > *:hover * { color: #123d66 !important; -webkit-text-fill-color: #123d66 !important; text-shadow: none !important; }
</style>
